<PolicyPage
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Readings on Oracle are provided for entertainment and personal reflection only and are not medical, legal, financial, or professional advice."
  path="/disclaimer/"
  heading="Disclaimer"
  lead="Readings are provided for entertainment and personal reflection purposes only."
  updated
>
  <section aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
    <h2 id="purpose-title">Entertainment and reflection</h2>
    <p>Tarot readings, horoscopes, zodiac guides, and compatibility results on Oracle are meant to be enjoyed and to prompt thoughtful reflection. They are not predictions, and they are not a substitute for your own judgment.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="advice-title">
    <h2 id="advice-title">Not professional advice</h2>
    <p>Nothing on this site is medical, legal, financial, or psychological advice, and none of it replaces a qualified professional such as a doctor, lawyer, financial adviser, or licensed counselor. Please do not use a reading to decide about your health, a legal matter, an investment, or a major life change. If you have a concern in one of those areas, talk to a professional who can look at your real circumstances.</p>
    <p>If you are in crisis or worried about your safety, please contact your local emergency services or a local crisis line right away.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="guarantee-title">
    <h2 id="guarantee-title">No guarantees</h2>
    <p>Oracle does not promise that any reading is accurate, complete, or relevant to your situation, and it does not guarantee any outcome. A sign or a card describes broad themes and general tendencies, and every person and relationship is more complicated than that. Readings about love, work, or money are prompts for thinking, not statements about what will happen.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="responsibility-title">
    <h2 id="responsibility-title">Your choices are your own</h2>
    <p>You are responsible for the decisions you make. Please use the readings the way you would use a good question from a friend: as a nudge to notice what you already think and feel.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="content-title">
    <h2 id="content-title">About the content</h2>
    <p>The interpretations reflect general traditions of tarot and astrology, written for this site. Traditions differ from one another, and other sources may read a card or a sign differently. We make a good-faith effort to keep the content clear and thoughtful, and we may revise it over time.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="more-title">
    <h2 id="more-title">Related pages</h2>
    <p>See the <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a> and the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>, or learn <a href="/how-it-works/">how the readings are put together</a>.</p>
  </section>
</PolicyPage>
